From f53aa8ba51583a058d25c95f212aa7072449bf7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HaraldKiessling <harald.kiessling@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Jan 2026 16:38:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Optimize display updates and reduce log output

- Change lv_clock to label for clock display (fixes format attribute warning)
- Add RTC nil-check to prevent type_error exceptions
- Reduce IP/SSID status queries from every second to every 60 seconds
- Add network_counter to SensorDashboard class
- Add initial network update after 5 seconds on startup
- Set Weblog level 2 for cleaner log output
- Extend DS18X20 sensor support from 8 to 10 sensors
- Add support for multiple BME280 sensors (BME280, BME280-1/2/3)
- Update pages.jsonl with label-based clock and 10 DS18x20 labels

Result: 98% reduction in status query log entries while maintaining full functionality

Co-authored-by: Ona <no-reply@ona.com>
